{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows dexmedetomidine hydrochloride injection has been current since 2020-04-10 with multiple manufacturers listed; no public FDA signal at our plants",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21", "D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list for dexmedetomidine hydrochloride injection shows a current status first posted 2020-04-10 and updated through 2026-10-19 across 13 manufacturers including Accord Healthcare Inc., Amneal Pharmaceuticals, Azurity Pharmaceuticals Inc., Baxter Healthcare, Eugia US LLC, Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Gland Pharma Limited, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., HQ Specialty Pharma, Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co. (two entries), and Meitheal Pharmaceuticals Inc.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 78 months."
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our supply of the 100 ug/mL 2 mL vial (NDC 0143-9532-25) is labeled Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. at both Corvale East and Corvale General."
      "cites": ["E1", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. appears on FDA's shortage list as current with initial posting 2020-04-10 and update 2026-10-14."
      "cites": ["E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No public FDA inspection classification (OAI, VAI, or NAI) is recorded for the plants supplying our sites."
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 59 vials at 7.1 per day for 8.3 days on hand; Corvale General holds 159 vials at 7.7 per day for 20.6 days on hand."
      "cites": ["D4", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected action is to transfer 41 vials of 100 ug/mL 2 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 14 days while Corvale General retains two weeks of supply."
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
}
